0..50 Comment "//! This source shows functors over theory models."
51..54 Comment "//!"
55..121 Comment "//! A functor parameter has the signature that its theory derives."
122..176 Comment "//! A model signature can also satisfy that parameter."
177..180 Comment "//!"
181..242 Comment "//! The checker matches each functor argument by member name."
243..306 Comment "//! The lowering preserves each model sort in the functor body."
307..310 Comment "//!"
311..327 Comment "//! - see: #1226"
